/2.2 = 1.8182pt`濡?**r???쎈텇??*\r\n    //     諛곗닔? 臾닿??댁?怨? ?쎌뒪泥?5遺??湲???믪씠??4.26~14.16pt???대뒓\r\n    //     ?몄텧遺?먯꽌???닿린吏 紐삵븳?? 怨좎젙 4pt濡??섎룎由щ㈃ ?대쾲??諛섎?濡?\n    //     醫곹엺 諛곗닔(0.5)瑜?h??pt ?꾨㈃?먯꽌 ?듭㎏濡??좎떇?쒕떎.\r\n    // (2) 吏??寃껋씠 ?덈떎??媛???먯껜媛 ?ㅼ륫?먯꽌 臾대꼫吏꾨떎. ?뚰븳 ?좏겙???щ윭\r\n    //     pdf.js ?꾩씠?쒖쑝濡?履쇨컻???묒? ?덈? 媛꾧꺽???⑤뒗???щ???肄뷀띁?ㅼ뿉\r\n    //     ?ㅼ옱?쒕떎 ??yokohama-p14 y??15.84????50x1000?띿씠 `650`쨌`x`쨌`1`쨌`000`\r\n    //     ???꾩씠?쒖쑝濡??⑤떎. 洹몃윴??**遺숈뿬????媛꾧꺽(`1`??000`)怨?媛덈씪????\n    //     媛꾧꺽(`650`??x`, `x`??1`)???꾨? ?뺥솗??4.9770pt濡?媛숇떎.** ?대뼡 ?섑븳??\n    //     ?섏쓣 媛瑜댁? 紐삵븳??????000?띿쓣 ?대━??媛믪? ?똸1000?띾룄 ?④퍡 留뚮뱺??\r\n    //     ?섑븳??吏?????덉뿀???좎씪???ㅻЪ???먮━?곸쑝濡?吏?????녿뒗 寃껋씠??\r\n    //\r\n    // 媛숈? ?꾩씠???덉쓽 湲?먮뒗 媛꾧꺽??**?뺥솗??0**?대떎(toTextItems媛\r\n    // `x = ?먯젏 + characterWidth*index`濡??볤퀬 洹?characterWidth瑜?w濡??ｋ뒗??.\r\n    // 洹몃옒????臾명꽦??媛瑜대뒗 寃껋? ?몄젣???꾩씠??**?ъ씠**?닿퀬, 臾명꽦??醫곹삍???뚯쓽\r\n    // ?ㅽ뙣??蹂묓빀???꾨땲??遺꾨━ ??吏?대궡吏 ?딄퀬 嫄곗젅?섎뒗 履쎌씠??\r\n    const threshold = previous ? Math.min(previous.h, item.h) * gapRatio : 0\r\n\r\n    if (!group || !previous || item.x - (previous.x + previous.w) > threshold) {\r\n      groups.push([item])\r\n    } else {\r\n      group.push(item)\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  return groups.map((group) => {\r\n    const text = group.map((item) => item.str).join('')\r\n    // ?멸렇癒쇳듃??諛붿슫??諛뺤뒪濡?x쨌endX쨌centerY瑜??곕떎(y??踰좎씠?ㅻ씪?몄씠??湲??\n    // ?섎굹??[y-h, y] 援ш컙). spread(Math.min(...)/Math.max(...))?????대떎 ??\n    // ?몄옄 ?섍? 湲由ы봽 ?섎? 洹몃?濡??곕씪媛 ?ㅽ깮 ?쒕룄?먯꽌 RangeError媛 ?쒕떎\r\n    // (verticalRuns??flush()? 媛숈? ?댁쑀. x쨌endX????踰????댁쑀濡?怨좎퀜吏?\n    // centerY ?놁뿉 spread??梨꾨줈 ?⑥븘 ?덉뿀????#32 ?댁썡 吏??(b)).\r\n    let x = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\r\n    let endX = Number.NEGATIVE_INFINITY\r\n    let top = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\r\n    let bottom = Number.NEGATIVE_INFINITY\r\n    for (const item of group) {\r\n      if (item.x < x) x = item.x\r\n      if (item.x + item.w > endX) endX = item.x + item.w\r\n      if (item.y - item.h < top) top = item.y - item.h\r\n      if (item.y > bottom) bottom = item.y\r\n    }\r\n    return {\r\n      text,\r\n      compact: compact(text),\r\n      items: group,\r\n      x,\r\n      endX,\r\n      centerX: (x + endX) / 2,\r\n      centerY: (top + bottom) / 2,\r\n    }\r\n  })\r\n}\r\n\r\nexport function recoverRows(items: TextItem[], gapRatio?: number): TextRow[] {\r\n  const rows: Array<Omit<TextRow, 'segments'>> = []\r\n  const horizontalItems = items\r\n    .filter(\r\n      (item) =>\r\n        item.str.trim().length > 0 &&\r\n        (item.rot === undefined || Math.abs(item.rot) < ROTATION_TOLERANCE_DEG),\r\n    )\r\n    .sort((left, right) => left.y - right.y || left.x - right.x)\r\n\r\n  for (const item of horizontalItems) {\r\n    let closest: Omit<TextRow, 'segments'> | undefined\r\n    let closestDistance = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\r\n\r\n    for (const row of rows) {\r\n      const distance = Math.abs(row.y - item.y)\r\n      const tolerance = Math.max(1, Math.min(row.height, item.h) * 0.3)\r\n      if (distance <= tolerance && distance < closestDistance) {\r\n        closest = row\r\n        closestDistance = distance\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    if (closest) {\r\n      closest.items.push(item)\r\n      closest.y =\r\n        closest.items.reduce((total, rowItem) => total + rowItem.y, 0) /\r\n        closest.items.length\r\n      closest.height = Math.max(closest.height, item.h)\r\n    } else {\r\n      rows.push({ y: item.y, height: item.h, items: [item] })\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  return rows\r\n    .sort((left, right) => left.y - right.y)\r\n    .map((row) => ({ ...row, segments: makeSegments(row.items, gapRatio) }))\r\n}\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * ?몃줈?곌린 臾몄옄?댁쓣 蹂듭썝?쒕떎. `recoverRows`???뚯쟾 ?꾩씠?쒖쓣 踰꾨┛????媛濡???蹂듭썝??\n * ?욎씠硫??됱씠 ?ㅼ뿼?섍린 ?뚮Ц?대떎. 洹?寃곌낵 ?ㅼ?移??놁뿉 ?몃줈濡??곹엺 移섏닔媛 ?듭㎏濡?蹂댁씠吏\r\n * ?딅뒗?? ??씊 ?쇰꺼 ?됱씠 ?녿뒗 ?쒖뿉?쒕뒗 洹멸쾬??d???좎씪??洹쇨굅??(ojkk ?긱꺁?밤깉).\r\n *\r\n * rot=-90留?諛쏅뒗?? ?쎄린 ?쒖꽌媛 y ?대┝李⑥닚??寃껋? ?ㅻЪ?먯꽌 ?뺤씤??媛믪씠怨? ?ㅻⅨ\r\n * ?뚯쟾媛곸? ?쒖꽌媛 ?ㅼ쭛?????덈떎 ????00?띿씠 ??07?띿씠 ?섎㈃ 議곗슜???由?媛믪씠 ?쒕떎.\r\n * ?뚯쟾 ?띿뒪?몄뿉??w??媛濡???씠 ?꾨땲??湲??吏꾪뻾?됱씠誘濡??몃줈 媛꾧꺽?쇰줈 ?대떎.\r\n *\r\n * `originGapRatio`???몄젒 ?먯젙 諛곗닔?댁?留?**makeSegments??`gapRatio`? ?щ뒗 ??곸씠\r\n * ?ㅻⅤ??*: makeSegments??吏꾪뻾?됱쓣 類 ?щ갚(`x - (previous.x + w)`)??怨깊븯怨? ?ш린?쒕뒗\r\n * ?먯젏 ?ъ씠 嫄곕━(`previous.y - y`)??怨깊븳?? 洹몃옒??媛숈? ?섎? ?ｌ뼱??媛숈? ?살씠 ?꾨땲怨?\n * ???좏겙 ?대? 媛꾧꺽??媛濡쒖뿉?쒕뒗 嫄곗쓽 0?몃뜲 ?몃줈?먯꽌???뺥솗??1w?????몃줈 諛곗닔??1??\n * ?섏뼱???쒕떎. ?대쫫???뚦렅?백뼋?붿쓽 諛곗닔?띾씪怨??щ뒗 ??곸쓣 ?닿퀬 ?덈뒗 ?댁쑀媛 ?닿쾬?대떎:\r\n * ????`gapRatio: number`?대㈃ ?몄텧遺媛 0.5? 1.5瑜?留욌컮轅??ｌ뼱????낆씠 留됱? 紐삵븳??\r\n *\r\n * **??異뺤씠 ?쒕줈 ?ㅻⅤ寃??먯뒯?덈뜕 寃껋씠 ?꾨땲??** ?몃줈 議곌굔??媛濡쒖쓽 泥숇룄濡???린硫?\n * `?щ갚 ??w쨌(諛곗닔??)`?닿퀬, 諛곗닔 2쨌w??.5h(?쎌뒪泥?5遺???レ옄 湲由ы봽 ?ㅼ륫 w/h??\n * 0.4977~0.5226)?먯꽌 洹?媛믪? 0.5h ??鴉뤷쎋 ?뚯꽌媛 ?곕뒗 媛濡?臾명꽦(`min(h)쨌0.5`)怨?\n * **媛숇떎**. ??湲곕낯媛?2??寃고븿? ?먯뒯?⑥씠 ?꾨땲??寃쎄퀎媛 ?ㅼ륫媛믨낵 ?뺥솗??寃뱀튇 寃껋씠??\n * (`VERTICAL_RUN_GAP_RATIO` 李멸퀬).\r\n */\r\nexport function verticalRuns(\r\n  items: TextItem[],\r\n  originGapRatio: number = VERTICAL_RUN_GAP_RATIO,\r\n): VerticalRun[] {\r\n  const rotated = items\r\n    .filter(\r\n      (item) =>\r\n        item.str.trim().length > 0 &&\r\n        item.rot !== undefined &&\r\n        Math.abs(item.rot + 90) < ROTATION_TOLERANCE_DEG,\r\n    )\r\n    .sort((left, right) => left.x - right.x || right.y - left.y)\r\n\r\n  const runs: VerticalRun[] = []\r\n  let current: TextItem[] = []\r\n\r\n  const flush = () => {\r\n    if (current.length === 0) return\r\n    // spread(Math.min(...))???몄옄 ?섍? ?ъ슜??PDF??湲由ы봽 ?섎? 洹몃?濡??곕씪媛\r\n    // ?ㅽ깮 ?쒕룄?먯꽌 RangeError媛 ?쒕떎 ???뚮뜑 寃쎈줈???꾪룷?멸? ?듭㎏濡?二쎈뒗??\n    //\r\n    // minY??item.y - item.w(?먯떊??吏꾪뻾?됰쭔???욎そ?쇰줈 ???섍컙 ????理쒖넖媛믪씠??\r\n    // ?먯젏(y) 洹몃?濡쒕? ?곕㈃ 留덉?留?湲?먯쓽 ?먯젏(=洹?湲?먯쓽 ?ㅼそ ???먯꽌 硫덉떠\r\n    // ?욎そ ?앹쓣 ?볦튇????VerticalRun.y??洹쒖빟 ?ㅻ챸 李멸퀬. maxY??蹂댁젙???녿떎:\r\n    // 泥?湲?먯쓽 ?먯젏???대? ???꾩껜???ㅼそ 諛붽묑 ?앹씠?????섍컝 ?곌? ?녿떎.\r\n    let minY = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\r\n    let maxY = Number.NEGATIVE_INFINITY\r\n    for (const item of current) {\r\n      if (item.y - item.w < minY) minY = item.y - item.w\r\n      if (item.y > maxY) maxY = item.y\r\n    }\r\n    runs.push({\r\n      text: compact(current.map((item) => item.str).join('')),\r\n      x: current[0].x,\r\n      y: (minY + maxY) / 2,\r\n    })\r\n    current = []\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  for (const item of rotated) {\r\n    const previous = current.at(-1)\r\n    // ?뺣젹??x ?곗꽑?대씪, x媛 1pt ?대궡濡??ㅻⅨ ???곗쓽 寃쎄퀎?먯꽌??y媛 嫄곌씀濡??⑤떎.\r\n    // ?섑븳???놁쑝硫?洹??뚯닔 媛꾧꺽??寃?щ? 臾댁“嫄??듦낵???쒕줈 ?ㅻⅨ 痢듭쓽 移섏닔媛\r\n    // ?댁뼱遺숇뒗??????00????00?띿씠 600500???섏뼱 ??痢듭씠 ???щ씪吏꾨떎\r\n    const gap = previous === undefined ? -1 : previous.y - item.y\r\n    const adjacent =\r\n      previous !== undefined &&\r\n      Math.abs(previous.x - item.x) <= COLUMN_TOLERANCE_PT &&\r\n      gap >= 0 &&\r\n      gap <= Math.max(previous.w, item.w) * originGapRatio\r\n    if (!adjacent) flush()\r\n    current.push(item)\r\n  }\r\n  flush()\r\n\r\n  return runs\r\n}\r\n\r\nimport { compact, recoverRows, verticalRuns, type TextSegment } from '../runs'\r\nimport type { TextItem } from '../types'\r\nimport type { TextPage } from '../section-list/types'\r\n\r\nimport type {\r\n  AxisCandidate,\r\n  MemberPlacement,\r\n  ParsedFramingPlan,\r\n  PlanBlock,\r\n  PlanGridCandidate,\r\n  PlanGridIssue,\r\n} from './types'\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * 鴉뤷쎋???싥굤??洹몃━?쒖? 遺??諛곗튂瑜??띿뒪???덉씠?대쭔?쇰줈 蹂듭썝?쒕떎 (ADR-030).\r\n *\r\n * ?ㅼ륫(2026-08-23 ?ㅽ뙆?댄겕, yokohama p5?뱎7쨌kani p38)??以 援ъ“:\r\n * 異??쇰꺼? ??諛대뱶(媛숈? x ?먮뒗 媛숈? y)???섏뼱?쒓퀬, ?ㅽ뙩 移섏닔 臾몄옄?댁?\r\n * ?몄젒 ?쇰꺼 醫뚰몴??**以묒젏**???볦씤???ㅼ륫 ?ㅼ감 ??pt). ?꾩껜 移섏닔媛 ?덉쑝硫?\n * 泥???以묒젏???볦뿬 ?⑷퀎 寃利앹떇???쒕떎. 遺??遺?몃뒗 寃⑹옄????쨌蹂??以묒젏\r\n * (鸚㎪쥈)쨌移?以묒븰(佯딀씮) 以??섎굹???볦씤?? 踰≫꽣 ?좊텇? ?곗? ?딅뒗????\n * 訝?백럷渶싳씠 吏㏃? 議곌컖?쇰줈 遺꾪빐???덇퀬 ?띿뒪?몃쭔?쇰줈 蹂듭썝???꾧껐?쒕떎.\r\n */\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * ?싥굤???쇰꺼 ?섎굹. ?뚮Ц???묐몢(b쨌c 竊?汝?援щ텇)???ㅼ륫 踰붿쐞????誘몄? ?쒓린(bX2A??\n * ?똀??媛숈? ?앯빁)??吏?대궡吏 ?딄퀬 ?뺤쭅?섍쾶 ?볦튇??(R10).\r\n *\r\n * sticky ?뚮옒洹몃뒗 ?뚯씠 ?멸렇癒쇳듃媛 ?쇰꺼???곗냽?쇰줈 ?④??놁씠 ?ㅻ챸?섎뒗媛?띾? 臾산린\r\n * ?꾪븳 寃껋씠????遺遺??쇱튂瑜??쇰꺼濡?諛쏆쑝硫??앯빁 異뺤씠 議곗슜??蹂몃쾲?쇰줈 ?붽컩?쒕떎.\r\n */\r\nconst AXIS_LABEL_PATTERN = /[a-z]?[XY]\\d+/y\r\n/** 移섏닔 臾몄옄?????쇳몴 援щ텇(6,000)怨?臾닿뎄遺?8700) ?????ㅻЪ???덈떎 */\r\nexport const DIMENSION_PATTERN = /^(?:\\d{1,3}(?:,\\d{3})+|\\d{2,})$/\r\n/**\r\n * 遺??遺?? ??씊?ゃ궧?덉쓽 寃?section-list??MARK_PATTERN)??S(佯딀씮)瑜??뷀뻽????\n * 鴉뤷쎋?먮뒗 ?ㅳ꺀??遺?멸? ?섏삤怨?由ъ뒪???쒖뿉???섏삤吏 ?딅뒗??\r\n */\r\nconst MARK_PATTERN = /^(?:C|G|FC|FG|B|CB|S|W)\\d+[A-Z]?$/\r\n/** 釉붾줉 ?쒕ぉ. ???롥틞鴉뤷쎋1/100?띿쿂??異뺤쿃??遺숈뼱 ?ㅻ?濡?遺遺??쇱튂濡?蹂몃떎 */\r\nconst BLOCK_TITLE_PATTERN = /鴉뤷쎋/\r\n\r\n// ?ㅼ륫 湲곕컲 ?덉슜?ㅼ감. 洹쇨굅???ㅽ뙆?댄겕 ?ㅼ륫媛믪씠怨?ADR-030???곸뿀??\r\n/** ?쇰꺼??媛숈? 諛대뱶濡?蹂대뒗 怨좎젙 醫뚰몴 ?덉슜?ㅼ감. ?ㅼ륫 ?몄감??1pt 誘몃쭔?대떎 */\r\nconst BAND_TOLERANCE_PT = 8\r\n/** 移섏닔 ?댁씠 ?쇰꺼 諛대뱶?먯꽌 ?⑥뼱吏????덈뒗 嫄곕━. ?ㅼ륫 理쒕? 50pt(kani X) */\r\nconst DIMENSION_WINDOW_PT = 60\r\n/** 移섏닔 以묒떖怨??몄젒 異?以묒젏???닿툔???덉슜. ?ㅼ륫 ?덉쟾 李쎌? 6pt ?댁긽 30pt 誘몃쭔?대떎.\r\n *  6pt 誘몃쭔?먯꽌??湲곗〈 移섏닔媛 鍮좎졇 野멩퀡轝좄맼, 30pt ?댁긽?먯꽌???ㅽ깘???ㅼ뼱? ?덅쮫訝띴??닿? ?쒕떎. */\r\nconst MIDPOINT_TOLERANCE_PT = 15\r\n/** ?ㅽ뙩蹂??ㅼ륫 異뺤쿃(pt/mm)??以묒븰媛??鍮??덉슜 ?몄감. ?ㅼ륫 理쒕? 0.5% */\r\nconst SCALE_TOLERANCE_RATIO = 0.03\r\n/**\r\n * 遺?몃? 寃⑹옄?먃룹쨷?먯뿉 遺숈씠???덉슜 嫄곕━ 竊?洹?諛⑺뼢 **以묒븰媛??ㅽ뙩**????鍮꾩쑉.\r\n *\r\n * ?몄젒 ?ㅽ뙩???곗? ?딅뒗 ?댁쑀媛 ?덈떎: ?ㅻЪ yokohama p7??bX3?밹X1? 1200mm(34pt)\r\n * 吏쒕━ 醫곸? ?좊씪, ?몄젒 ?ㅽ뙩 湲곗??대㈃ ?덉슜??8pt濡?醫곸븘??凉뺝눣渶싳쑝濡?20pt易?\n * 鍮꾩폒 ?곹엺 ??遺?멸? ?듭㎏濡??⑥뼱吏꾨떎. 以묒븰媛믪? 洹?醫곸? ???섎굹???붾뱾由ъ? ?딅뒗??\r\n *\r\n * 1/4???섍만 ?섎뒗 ?녿떎 ??寃⑹옄?먭낵 以묒젏??諛??ㅽ뙩 媛꾧꺽?대?濡?1/4???뚯뼱??履쎌뿉??\n * 遺숈씪 ???덈떎?띿쓽 寃쎄퀎?? 洹몃낫???ш쾶 ?≪쑝硫??대뒓 履쎌씤吏 ?쒗뭹??怨좊Ⅴ寃??쒕떎.\r\n */\r\nconst SNAP_RATIO = 0.25\r\n/**\r\n * X쨌Y ??吏앹????곹븳 竊?X ?싥굤??쓽 以묒븰媛??ㅼ륫 ?ㅽ뙩 횞 ??鍮꾩쑉.\r\n * ?섏씠吏 異뺤쿃???곕씪 ?④퍡 蹂?섍퀬, Y ?쇰꺼 ?좉? ????ㅽ뙩 1.5移몃낫??硫硫?\n * 媛숈? 鴉뤷쎋?대씪??湲고븯 洹쇨굅媛 ?놁쑝誘濡?釉붾줉???댁? ?딅뒗??\r\n */\r\nconst GRID_PAIRING_DISTANCE_RATIO = 1.5\r\n\r\ninterface LabelToken {\r\n  label: string\r\n  letter: 'X' | 'Y'\r\n  x: number\r\n  y: number\r\n}\r\n\r\ninterface PositionedToken {\r\n  text: string\r\n  x: number\r\n  y: number\r\n}\r\n\r\ninterface DimensionToken {\r\n  valueMm: number\r\n  x: number\r\n  y: number\r\n}\r\n\r\ninterface AxisSequence {\r\n  letters: Set<'X' | 'Y'>\r\n  /** positionPt媛 ?대뒓 醫뚰몴?멸? ??移섏닔 留ㅼ묶??媛숈? 醫뚰몴瑜?遊먯빞 ?쒕떎 */\r\n  alongKey: 'x' | 'y'\r\n  /** 諛대뱶??怨좎젙 醫뚰몴(?됯퇏) ??移섏닔 李쎌쓽 湲곗? */\r\n  across: number\r\n  axes: AxisCandidate[]\r\n}\r\n\r\n/** 移섏닔쨌異뺤쿃源뚯? ?뺤씤???앸궃 異??? 洹몃━???뺤쓽? 釉붾줉???????ш린???섏삩??*/\r\ninterface ValidatedSequence extends AxisSequence {\r\n  direction: 'X' | 'Y'\r\n  spansMm: number[]\r\n  scalePtPerMm: number\r\n  totalConfirmed: boolean\r\n}\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * ?멸렇癒쇳듃 ?섎굹瑜??쇰꺼???곗냽?쇰줈 ?섍?瑜몃떎. `makeSegments`???쒖쓽 移몄쓣 臾띠쑝?ㅺ퀬\r\n * 留뚮뱺 洹쒖튃?대씪 ?몄젒?????싥굤??쓣 ???⑹씠濡?遺숈씤?????ㅻЪ yokohama p7?먯꽌\r\n * `bX3`(34pt 媛꾧꺽)? `cX1`???똟X3cX1?띿씠 ?먮떎.\r\n *\r\n * ?섍?瑜??쇰꺼??醫뚰몴??**洹??쇰꺼???대， 臾몄옄?ㅼ뿉??* ?ㅼ떆 ?곕떎. ?깅텇쨌蹂닿컙?쇰줈\r\n * 留뚮뱾硫??꾨㈃???녿뒗 ?꾩튂瑜??쒗뭹???뺥븯??寃껋씠 ?섍퀬, 洹??꾩튂媛 洹몃?濡??ㅽ뙩\r\n * 移섏닔??以묒젏 ?먯젙???곗씤??\r\n *\r\n * ?멸렇癒쇳듃 ?꾩껜媛 ?쇰꺼濡??④??놁씠 ?ㅻ챸???뚮쭔 諛쏅뒗??\r\n */\r\nfunction splitAxisLabels(segment: TextSegment, y: number): LabelToken[] {\r\n  // NFKC媛 ??湲?먮? ?щ윭 湲?먮줈 ?대뒗 寃쎌슦媛 ?덉쑝誘濡?1:1??媛?뺥븯吏 ?딄퀬\r\n  // 臾몄옄留덈떎 ?띿뒪?몄긽??援ш컙??湲곕줉???섏갼?붾떎\r\n  let text = ''\r\n  const spans: Array<{ start: number; end: number; item: TextItem }> = []\r\n  for (const item of segment.items) {\r\n    const piece = compact(item.str)\r\n    if (piece === '') continue\r\n    spans.push({ start: text.length, end: text.length + piece.length, item })\r\n    text += piece\r\n  }\r\n  if (text === '') return []\r\n\r\n  const tokens: LabelToken[] = []\r\n  AXIS_LABEL_PATTERN.lastIndex = 0\r\n  while (AXIS_LABEL_PATTERN.lastIndex < text.length) {\r\n    const start = AXIS_LABEL_PATTERN.lastIndex\r\n    const match = AXIS_LABEL_PATTERN.exec(text)\r\n    if (!match) return []\r\n    const end = AXIS_LABEL_PATTERN.lastIndex\r\n\r\n    const owned = spans\r\n      .filter((span) => span.start < end && span.end > start)\r\n      .map((span) => span.item)\r\n    if (owned.length === 0) return []\r\n\r\n    let minX = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\r\n    let maxX = Number.NEGATIVE_INFINITY\r\n    for (const item of owned) {\r\n      if (item.x < minX) minX = item.x\r\n      if (item.x + item.w > maxX) maxX = item.x + item.w\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    tokens.push({\r\n      label: match[0],\r\n      letter: match[0].includes('X') ? 'X' : 'Y',\r\n      x: (minX + maxX) / 2,\r\n      y,\r\n    })\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  return tokens\r\n}\r\n\r\ninterface CollectedTokens {\r\n  labels: LabelToken[]\r\n  dimensions: DimensionToken[]\r\n  marks: PositionedToken[]\r\n  titles: PositionedToken[]\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction collectTokens(page: TextPage): CollectedTokens {\r\n  const labels: LabelToken[] = []\r\n  const dimensions: DimensionToken[] = []\r\n  const marks: PositionedToken[] = []\r\n  const titles: PositionedToken[] = []\r\n\r\n  const classify = (text: string, x: number, y: number) => {\r\n    if (DIMENSION_PATTERN.test(text)) {\r\n      dimensions.push({\r\n        valueMm: Number.parseInt(text.replaceAll(',', ''), 10),\r\n        x,\r\n        y,\r\n      })\r\n      return\r\n    }\r\n    if (MARK_PATTERN.test(text)) {\r\n      marks.push({ text, x, y })\r\n      return\r\n    }\r\n    if (BLOCK_TITLE_PATTERN.test(text)) titles.push({ text, x, y })\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  for (const row of recoverRows(page.items)) {\r\n    for (const segment of row.segments) {\r\n      labels.push(...splitAxisLabels(segment, row.y))\r\n      classify(segment.compact, segment.centerX, row.y)\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  // ?몃줈?곌린??臾몄옄 醫뚰몴媛 ?몃줈濡??먮Ⅴ誘濡??섍?瑜닿린瑜?嫄몄? ?딅뒗?????ㅼ륫 肄뷀띁?ㅼ쓽\r\n  // ?몃줈 ?곗? 移섏닔肉먯씠怨? ?몃줈 ?쇰꺼??遺숈뼱 ?섏삤???꾨㈃? 鍮??꾨낫濡??ㅽ뙣?쒕떎 (R10)\r\n  for (const run of verticalRuns(page.items)) {\r\n    if (/^[a-z]?[XY]\\d+$/.test(run.text)) {\r\n      labels.push({\r\n        label: run.text,\r\n        letter: run.text.includes('X') ? 'X' : 'Y',\r\n        x: run.x,\r\n        y: run.y,\r\n      })\r\n      continue\r\n    }\r\n    classify(run.text, run.x, run.y)\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  return { labels, dimensions, marks, titles }\r\n}\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * ?쇰꺼?ㅼ쓣 怨좎젙 醫뚰몴媛 ?댁뼱吏??諛대뱶濡?臾띔퀬, 諛대뱶 ?덉뿉???꾩튂 ?ㅻ쫫李⑥닚?쇰줈\r\n * ?섏뼱?볦? ???쇰꺼??諛섎났?섎뒗 ?먮━?먯꽌 媛덈씪 異??댁쓣 留뚮뱺???????섏씠吏??\n * 媛숈? 洹몃━?쒖쓽 鴉뤷쎋媛 ?щ윭 釉붾줉 ?덉쑝硫??ㅻЪ p7) 媛숈? 諛대뱶???댁씠 諛섎났?쒕떎.\r\n */\r\nfunction axisSequences(\r\n  labels: LabelToken[],\r\n  across: 'x' | 'y',\r\n): AxisSequence[] {\r\n  const along = across === 'x' ? 'y' : 'x'\r\n  const sorted = [...labels].sort((a, b) => a[across] - b[across])\r\n  const bands: LabelToken[][] = []\r\n\r\n  for (const token of sorted) {\r\n    const band = bands.at(-1)\r\n    const previous = band?.at(-1)\r\n    if (\r\n      band &&\r\n      previous &&\r\n      token[across] - previous[across] <= BAND_TOLERANCE_PT\r\n    ) {\r\n      band.push(token)\r\n    } else {\r\n      bands.push([token])\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  const sequences: AxisSequence[] = []\r\n  for (const band of bands) {\r\n    if (band.length < 2) continue\r\n    const ordered = [...band].sort((a, b) => a[along] - b[along])\r\n\r\n    let current: LabelToken[] = []\r\n    const flush = () => {\r\n      if (current.length >= 2) {\r\n        sequences.push({\r\n          letters: new Set(current.map((token) => token.letter)),\r\n          alongKey: along,\r\n          across:\r\n            current.reduce((total, token) => total + token[across], 0) /\r\n            current.length,\r\n          axes: current.map((token) => ({\r\n            label: token.label,\r\n            positionPt: token[along],\r\n          })),\r\n        })\r\n      }\r\n      current = []\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    for (const token of ordered) {\r\n      if (current.some((seen) => seen.label === token.label)) flush()\r\n      current.push(token)\r\n    }\r\n    flush()\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  return sequences\r\n}\r\n\r\n/** ?몄젒 異??띿쓽 以묒젏?먯꽌, ?쇰꺼 諛대뱶??移섏닔 李??덉뿉 ?덈뒗 移섏닔瑜?李얜뒗??*/\r\nfunction dimensionAt(\r\n  dimensions: DimensionToken[],\r\n  used: Set<DimensionToken>,\r\n  along: 'x' | 'y',\r\n  across: 'x' | 'y',\r\n  midpoint: number,\r\n  bandAcross: number,\r\n): DimensionToken | undefined {\r\n  let best: DimensionToken | undefined\r\n  let bestDistance = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\r\n\r\n  for (const token of dimensions) {\r\n    if (used.has(token)) continue\r\n    const alongDistance = Math.abs(token[along] - midpoint)\r\n    if (alongDistance > MIDPOINT_TOLERANCE_PT) continue\r\n    if (Math.abs(token[across] - bandAcross) > DIMENSION_WINDOW_PT) continue\r\n    if (alongDistance < bestDistance) {\r\n      best = token\r\n      bestDistance = alongDistance\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  return best\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction median(values: number[]): number {\r\n  return [...values].sort((a, b) => a - b)[Math.floor(values.length / 2)]\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction validateSequence(\r\n  sequence: AxisSequence,\r\n  dimensions: DimensionToken[],\r\n  issue: (code: PlanGridIssue) => void,\r\n): ValidatedSequence | undefined {\r\n  if (sequence.letters.size > 1) {\r\n    issue('?⒲깧?ユ뻼耶쀦렁??)\r\n    return undefined\r\n  }\r\n  const alongKey = sequence.alongKey\r\n  const acrossKey: 'x' | 'y' = alongKey === 'y' ? 'x' : 'y'\r\n\r\n  const used = new Set<DimensionToken>()\r\n  const spans: DimensionToken[] = []\r\n  for (let i = 0; i + 1 < sequence.axes.length; i++) {\r\n    const midpoint =\r\n      (sequence.axes[i].positionPt + sequence.axes[i + 1].positionPt) / 2\r\n    const dimension = dimensionAt(\r\n      dimensions,\r\n      used,\r\n      alongKey,\r\n      acrossKey,\r\n      midpoint,\r\n      sequence.across,\r\n    )\r\n    if (!dimension) break\r\n    used.add(dimension)\r\n    spans.push(dimension)\r\n  }\r\n  if (spans.length < sequence.axes.length - 1) {\r\n    issue('野멩퀡轝좄맼')\r\n    return undefined\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  // ?ㅽ뙩蹂??ㅼ륫 異뺤쿃??媛덈━硫?移섏닔 ?ㅻ같?뺤씠????議곗슜??洹몃━?쒕? ?대뒓???ㅽ뙣?쒕떎\r\n  const scales = spans.map(\r\n    (span, i) =>\r\n      (sequence.axes[i + 1].positionPt - sequence.axes[i].positionPt) /\r\n      span.valueMm,\r\n  )\r\n  const medianScale = median(scales)\r\n  if (\r\n    scales.some(\r\n      (scale) => Math.abs(scale / medianScale - 1) > SCALE_TOLERANCE_RATIO,\r\n    )\r\n  ) {\r\n    issue('潁?갰訝띷빐??)\r\n    return undefined\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  // ?꾩껜 移섏닔(泥???以묒젏)媛 ?덉쑝硫??⑷퀎 寃利앹떇?쇰줈 ?대떎 ??遺덉씪移섎뒗 ?ㅻ룆 ?좏샇??\n  const spanSum = spans.reduce((sum, span) => sum + span.valueMm, 0)\r\n  const first = sequence.axes[0].positionPt\r\n  const last = sequence.axes.at(-1)?.positionPt ?? first\r\n  const total = dimensionAt(\r\n    dimensions,\r\n    used,\r\n    alongKey,\r\n    acrossKey,\r\n    (first + last) / 2,\r\n    sequence.across,\r\n  )\r\n  if (total && total.valueMm !== spanSum) {\r\n    issue('?덅쮫訝띴???)\r\n    return undefined\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  return {\r\n    ...sequence,\r\n    direction: [...sequence.letters][0],\r\n    spansMm: spans.map((span) => span.valueMm),\r\n    scalePtPerMm: medianScale,\r\n    totalConfirmed: total !== undefined,\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction extent(axes: AxisCandidate[]): { min: number; max: number } {\r\n  return {\r\n    min: axes[0].positionPt,\r\n    max: axes[axes.length - 1].positionPt,\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n/** ?먯뿉??援ш컙源뚯???嫄곕━. 援ш컙 ?덉씠硫?0 */\r\nfunction distanceToRange(value: number, min: number, max: number): number {\r\n  if (value < min) return min - value\r\n  if (value > max) return value - max\r\n  return 0\r\n}\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * 遺?멸? 遺숇뒗 ?먮━瑜?留뚮뱺????寃⑹옄?먭낵 洹??ъ씠 以묒젏??踰덇컝???볦씤 ?덇툑?대떎.\r\n * 吏앹닔 index媛 寃⑹옄??index/2), ??섍? 以묒젏(?ъ씠 (index-1)/2).\r\n */\r\nfunction snapTargets(axes: AxisCandidate[]): number[] {\r\n  const targets: number[] = []\r\n  for (let i = 0; i < axes.length; i++) {\r\n    targets.push(axes[i].positionPt)\r\n    if (i + 1 < axes.length) {\r\n      targets.push((axes[i].positionPt + axes[i + 1].positionPt) / 2)\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  return targets\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction spanLengths(axes: AxisCandidate[]): number[] {\r\n  return axes\r\n    .slice(1)\r\n    .map((axis, i) => axis.positionPt - axes[i].positionPt)\r\n}\r\n\r\ninterface Snap {\r\n  index: number\r\n  onNode: boolean\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction snap(\r\n  value: number,\r\n  axes: AxisCandidate[],\r\n  limit: number,\r\n): Snap | undefined {\r\n  const targets = snapTargets(axes)\r\n  let best = -1\r\n  let bestDistance = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\r\n  for (let i = 0; i < targets.length; i++) {\r\n    const distance = Math.abs(targets[i] - value)\r\n    if (distance < bestDistance) {\r\n      best = i\r\n      bestDistance = distance\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n  if (best < 0 || bestDistance > limit) return undefined\r\n  return { index: best >> 1, onNode: best % 2 === 0 }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction placementFor(\r\n  mark: string,\r\n  x: Snap,\r\n  y: Snap,\r\n): MemberPlacement {\r\n  if (x.onNode && y.onNode) {\r\n    return { mark, role: '?쇔춴??, ix: x.index, iy: y.index }\r\n  }\r\n  if (!x.onNode && y.onNode) {\r\n    return { mark, role: '渦?, ix: x.index, iy: y.index, axis: 'X' }\r\n  }\r\n  if (x.onNode && !y.onNode) {\r\n    return { mark, role: '渦?, ix: x.index, iy: y.index, axis: 'Y' }\r\n  }\r\n  return { mark, role: '?쇻궎', ix: x.index, iy: y.index }\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction gridCandidate(sequence: ValidatedSequence): PlanGridCandidate {\r\n  return {\r\n    direction: sequence.direction,\r\n    axes: sequence.axes,\r\n    spansMm: sequence.spansMm,\r\n    scalePtPerMm: sequence.scalePtPerMm,\r\n    totalConfirmed: sequence.totalConfirmed,\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\n/**\r\n * 釉붾줉??吏볥뒗????X ???섎굹? **媛??媛源뚯슫** Y ???섎굹瑜?吏앹쭞?붾떎.\r\n *\r\n * 怨좎젙 ?щ갚?쇰줈 ?뚰룷?ⓦ띿쓣 ?먯젙?섏? ?딅뒗 ?댁쑀: ?쇰꺼? ?꾨㈃ 諛붽묑???볦씠誘濡?\n * ?щ갚???꾩슂?쒕뜲(?ㅻЪ 156pt), 洹??щ갚???볧엳硫???釉붾줉???닿퉴吏 ?쇳궓??\r\n * 理쒓렐?묒? 洹??ъ씠瑜??ъ? ?딄퀬???녹? 吏앹쓣 怨좊Ⅸ??\r\n *\r\n * 媛숈? 釉붾줉???꽷룹븘???쇰꺼 ?좊뒗 異??꾩튂媛 媛숈쑝誘濡?洹??먮━?먯꽌 ?섎굹濡??묓엺??\r\n */\r\nfunction buildBlocks(\r\n  xSequences: ValidatedSequence[],\r\n  ySequences: ValidatedSequence[],\r\n  marks: PositionedToken[],\r\n  titles: PositionedToken[],\r\n  issue: (code: PlanGridIssue) => void,\r\n): PlanBlock[] {\r\n  const blocks: PlanBlock[] = []\r\n  if (xSequences.length === 0 || ySequences.length === 0) return blocks\r\n\r\n  const seen = new Set<string>()\r\n  const claimedY = new Map<ValidatedSequence, string>()\r\n\r\n  for (const xSequence of xSequences) {\r\n    const xExtent = extent(xSequence.axes)\r\n    const xKey = xSequence.axes\r\n      .map((axis) => `${axis.label}@${Math.round(axis.positionPt)}`)\r\n      .join(',')\r\n    const pairingLimit =\r\n      median(spanLengths(xSequence.axes)) * GRID_PAIRING_DISTANCE_RATIO\r\n    let paired: ValidatedSequence | undefined\r\n    let pairedDistance = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\r\n    let tied = false\r\n    for (const ySequence of ySequences) {\r\n      const claimedBy = claimedY.get(ySequence)\r\n      if (claimedBy !== undefined && claimedBy !== xKey) continue\r\n      const distance = distanceToRange(\r\n        ySequence.across,\r\n        xExtent.min,\r\n        xExtent.max,\r\n      )\r\n      if (distance < pairedDistance) {\r\n        paired = ySequence\r\n        pairedDistance = distance\r\n        tied = false\r\n      } else if (distance === pairedDistance) {\r\n        tied = true\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n    if (!paired || tied || pairedDistance > pairingLimit) {\r\n      issue('?싥굤???恙쒍툖??)\r\n      continue\r\n    }\r\n    claimedY.set(paired, xKey)\r\n\r\n    const xGrid = gridCandidate(xSequence)\r\n    const yGrid = gridCandidate(paired)\r\n    const xAxes = xGrid.axes\r\n    const yAxes = yGrid.axes\r\n    const key = [xAxes, yAxes]\r\n      .map((axes) =>\r\n        axes\r\n          .map((axis) => `${axis.label}@${Math.round(axis.positionPt)}`)\r\n          .join(','),\r\n      )\r\n      .join('|')\r\n    if (seen.has(key)) continue\r\n    seen.add(key)\r\n\r\n    const xLimit = median(spanLengths(xAxes)) * SNAP_RATIO\r\n    const yLimit = median(spanLengths(yAxes)) * SNAP_RATIO\r\n    const yExtent = extent(yAxes)\r\n\r\n    const placements: MemberPlacement[] = []\r\n    const unplacedMarks: string[] = []\r\n    for (const mark of marks) {\r\n      // 釉붾줉 諛뽰쓽 遺?몃뒗 ?꾩삁 蹂댁? ?딅뒗????媛숈? ?섏씠吏????씊?ゃ궧?덇? ?욎씤??\r\n      // ?먯젙 ?щ갚???ㅻ깄 ?덉슜怨?媛숆쾶 ?먯뼱, ?뚮툝濡??덉씤??紐?遺숈??ㅳ띿?\r\n      // ?뚮툝濡?諛뽰씠?ㅳ띻? 媛숈? ?먮줈 媛덈━寃??쒕떎\r\n      if (distanceToRange(mark.x, xExtent.min, xExtent.max) > xLimit) continue\r\n      if (distanceToRange(mark.y, yExtent.min, yExtent.max) > yLimit) continue\r\n\r\n      const x = snap(mark.x, xAxes, xLimit)\r\n      const y = snap(mark.y, yAxes, yLimit)\r\n      if (!x || !y) {\r\n        if (!unplacedMarks.includes(mark.text)) unplacedMarks.push(mark.text)\r\n        continue\r\n      }\r\n      placements.push(placementFor(mark.text, x, y))\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    // ?쒕ぉ? 釉붾줉??媛濡?踰붿쐞 ?덉뿉 ?덈뒗 寃껊쭔 蹂몃떎 ???섎???????鴉뤷쎋?먯꽌\r\n    // ?몃줈 嫄곕━留뚯쑝濡?怨좊Ⅴ硫???釉붾줉???쒕ぉ??遺숇뒗??\n    let title: string | undefined\r\n    let titleDistance = Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY\r\n    for (const candidate of titles) {\r\n      if (distanceToRange(candidate.x, xExtent.min, xExtent.max) > 0) continue\r\n      const distance = distanceToRange(candidate.y, yExtent.min, yExtent.max)\r\n      if (distance < titleDistance) {\r\n        title = candidate.text\r\n        titleDistance = distance\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    blocks.push({\r\n      ...(title === undefined ? {} : { title }),\r\n      xGrid,\r\n      yGrid,\r\n      placements,\r\n      unplacedMarks,\r\n    })\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  return blocks.sort(\r\n    (a, b) =>\r\n      a.xGrid.axes[0].positionPt - b.xGrid.axes[0].positionPt ||\r\n      a.yGrid.axes[0].positionPt - b.yGrid.axes[0].positionPt,\r\n  )\r\n}\r\n\r\nexport function parseFramingPlan(page: TextPage): ParsedFramingPlan {\r\n  const { labels, dimensions, marks, titles } = collectTokens(page)\r\n\r\n  const issues: PlanGridIssue[] = []\r\n  const issue = (code: PlanGridIssue) => {\r\n    if (!issues.includes(code)) issues.push(code)\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  if (labels.length === 0) {\r\n    return { grids: [], blocks: [], issues: ['?싥굤??꺀?쇻꺂?ゆ쩂??] }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  // ?쇰꺼 臾몄옄?댁씠 媛濡쒕줈 ?볦뿬??諛대뱶(異뺤쓽 ?섏뼱??諛⑺뼢)???몃줈?????덈떎 ??\n  // ??諛⑺뼢 ??臾띠뼱 蹂닿퀬, 寃利?以묒젏 移섏닔쨌異뺤쿃)??媛吏?諛대뱶瑜?嫄몃윭?몃떎.\r\n  const validated = [\r\n    ...axisSequences(labels, 'x'),\r\n    ...axisSequences(labels, 'y'),\r\n  ].flatMap((sequence) => {\r\n    const result = validateSequence(sequence, dimensions, issue)\r\n    return result ? [result] : []\r\n  })\r\n\r\n  const grids: PlanGridCandidate[] = []\r\n  const seen = new Set<string>()\r\n  for (const sequence of validated) {\r\n    const candidate = gridCandidate(sequence)\r\n    const key = [\r\n      candidate.direction,\r\n      candidate.axes.map((axis) => axis.label).join(','),\r\n      candidate.spansMm.join(','),\r\n    ].join('|')\r\n    if (seen.has(key)) continue\r\n    seen.add(key)\r\n    grids.push(candidate)\r\n  }\r\n  grids.sort(\r\n    (a, b) =>\r\n      a.direction.localeCompare(b.direction) ||\r\n      a.axes[0].positionPt - b.axes[0].positionPt,\r\n  )\r\n\r\n  const blocks = buildBlocks(\r\n    validated.filter((sequence) => sequence.direction === 'X'),\r\n    validated.filter((sequence) => sequence.direction === 'Y'),\r\n    marks,\r\n    titles,\r\n    issue,\r\n  )\r\n\r\n  return { grids, blocks, issues }\r\n}\r\n\r\nimport { readFileSync } from 'node:fs'\r\nimport { resolve } from 'node:path'\r\n\r\nimport { describe, expect, it } from 'vitest'\r\n\r\nimport {\r\n  DIMENSION_PATTERN,\r\n  parseFramingPlan,\r\n} from '@/lib/import/framing-plan/parse'\r\nimport type { PlanGridCandidate } from '@/lib/import/framing-plan/types'\r\nimport type { TextPage } from '@/lib/import/section-list/types'\r\nimport { recoverRows, verticalRuns } from '@/lib/import/runs'\r\n\r\n// TextItem ?쎌뒪泥?肄뷀띁?ㅻ뒗 section-import? 怨듭쑀?쒕떎 ??醫뚰몴 洹쒖빟怨??쒖젣? ?쒖쇅瑜?\n// ???뚯씠?꾨씪??scripts/extract-textitems.mjs)??蹂댁쬆?섍린 ?뚮Ц?대떎.\r\ntype TextItemFixture = {\r\n  page: Pick<TextPage, 'widthPt' | 'heightPt'>\r\n  items: TextPage['items']\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction readPage(file: string): TextPage {\r\n  const fixturePath = resolve(\r\n    process.cwd(),\r\n    'tests/fixtures/section-import/textitems',\r\n    file,\r\n  )\r\n  const fixture = JSON.parse(\r\n    readFileSync(fixturePath, 'utf8'),\r\n  ) as TextItemFixture\r\n\r\n  return { ...fixture.page, items: fixture.items }\r\n}\r\n\r\nconst DRAWING_FIXTURES = [\r\n  'kani-p38.json',\r\n  'kani-p40.json',\r\n  'ojkk-p2.json',\r\n  'ojkk-p3.json',\r\n  'yokohama-p13.json',\r\n  'yokohama-p14.json',\r\n  'yokohama-p7.json',\r\n  'yokohama-p8.json',\r\n]\r\n\r\nfunction dimensionCandidates(page: TextPage): string[] {\r\n  const horizontal = recoverRows(page.items).flatMap((row) =>\r\n    row.segments.map((segment) => segment.compact),\r\n  )\r\n  const vertical = verticalRuns(page.items).map((run) => run.text)\r\n  return [...horizontal, ...vertical].filter((text) =>\r\n    DIMENSION_PATTERN.test(text),\r\n  )\r\n}\r\n\r\nit('?ㅻ룄硫?8遺??媛濡쑣룹꽭濡?移섏닔 ?꾨낫?먮뒗 0mm ?댄븯媛 ?녿떎', () => {\r\n  // ??媛?쒕뒗 ?뚯꽌 異쒕젰???꾨땲??runs.ts???멸렇癒쇳듃 臾명꽦 遺덈??앹씠??\r\n  // ?ㅼ륫??湲곕낯 臾명꽦?먯꽌??8遺 紐⑤몢 0嫄댁씠怨? gapRatio瑜?0.5濡???텛硫?\n  // yokohama-p14????50x1000?띿씠 650쨌x쨌1쨌000?쇰줈 媛덈씪??000??4嫄??섏삩??\r\n  // 0.8쨌0.7쨌0.6?먯꽌??移⑤У?섎?濡?珥섏킌??寃쎄퀎媛 ?꾨땶 援듭? ?몃┰??댁뼱??\r\n  // ?몃줈 `VERTICAL_RUN_GAP_RATIO`??媛濡쒖? 媛숈? 援듭? ?몃┰??댁뼱?? 8遺 ?꾩껜??媛숈?\r\n  // ???몄젒?띿뿉??`gap / max(w)` 理쒖넖媛믪? 1.000000?닿퀬, 1 誘몃쭔???띿? 0媛쒖???\n  // (6?먮━ 諛섏삱由?湲곗?; ?먯떆 理쒖넖媛믪? 遺?숈냼??ULP ?붿감濡?0.9999999999999634).\r\n  // 0.99쨌0.8쨌0.5쨌0.3?먯꽌??紐⑤뱺 ?곗씠 1湲?먮줈 媛덈씪??`DIMENSION_PATTERN`\r\n  // ?듦낵媛 0嫄댁씠?? 諛곗닔媛 ?뺥솗??1.0???뚮뒗 李?`(1w, 2w)`???섎떒 紐⑥꽌由ъ뿉??\n  // `00`쨌`000` 議곌컖???앷꺼 0mm 媛?쒓? ?몃ŉ, kani-p38 3嫄?쨌 ojkk-p3 21嫄?쨌\r\n  // yokohama-p7 13嫄?쨌 yokohama-p8 3嫄댁씠??\r\n  const measured = DRAWING_FIXTURES.map((file) => {\r\n    const candidates = dimensionCandidates(readPage(file))\r\n    return {\r\n      file,\r\n      nonPositive: candidates.filter(\r\n        (text) => Number.parseInt(text.replaceAll(',', ''), 10) <= 0,\r\n      ),\r\n    }\r\n  })\r\n\r\n  expect(measured).toEqual(\r\n    DRAWING_FIXTURES.map((file) => ({ file, nonPositive: [] })),\r\n  )\r\n})\r\n\r\n// ?????섏씠吏 以?異??쇰꺼 紐⑥뼇???멸렇癒쇳듃瑜?媛吏?寃껋? yokohama-p14 ?섎굹肉먯씠??\n// (12媛? `X2塋?쨌`X3塋?쨌`Y2塋?쨌`Y3塋?쨌`Y4塋?쨌`Y5塋???諛섎났). yokohama-p13쨌ojkk-p2쨌\r\n// ojkk-p3? 媛곴컖 0媛쒕씪 ?쇰꺼 ?꾨낫 ?먯껜媛 ?녿떎. ??援щ퀎? ?먯????먮낯 ?뚯뒪?몄뿉??\n// 紐낆떆???덉뿀怨? ?ㅼ륫 洹쇨굅??fa5ab24??tests/section-import/plan-grid.test.ts???⑥븘 ?덈떎.\r\n//\r\n// ??grid-parse??X2쨌X3瑜?癒쇱? ?쇰꺼濡?李얠? ?? ?ㅽ뙩 1蹂?異뺤? 寃?곗씠\r\n// 怨듯쉶?꾪븳?ㅻ뒗 ?댁쑀濡?`?븅뼋?겻툖擁??쇰줈 嫄곗젅?덈떎. framing-plan? 湲곗쟾??\n// ?ㅻⅤ?? ?ㅼ젣 ?멸렇癒쇳듃??`X2塋?쨌`Y4塋?泥섎읆 ?쇰꺼 ?ㅼ뿉 `塋???遺숈뼱 ?덇퀬,\r\n// sticky AXIS_LABEL_PATTERN? X2瑜?留ㅼ튂?????⑥? 塋?퉴吏 ?뚮퉬?섏? 紐삵븳??\r\n// splitAxisLabels媛 ?멸렇癒쇳듃 ?꾩껜瑜??ㅻ챸?섏? 紐삵븳 寃껋쑝濡?蹂닿퀬 鍮?諛곗뿴??\n// 諛섑솚?섎?濡? framing-plan? ?쇰꺼??李얘린 ???④퀎?먯꽌 `?싥굤??꺀?쇻꺂?ゆ쩂?????몃떎.\r\ndescribe('??씊?ゃ궧??pages do not produce framing grids', () => {\r\n  it('does not invent grids from axis-like section marks', () => {\r\n    const files = [\r\n      'yokohama-p14.json',\r\n      'yokohama-p13.json',\r\n      'ojkk-p2.json',\r\n      'ojkk-p3.json',\r\n    ]\r\n\r\n    expect(\r\n      files.map((file) => {\r\n        const parsed = parseFramingPlan(readPage(file))\r\n        return {\r\n          file,\r\n          grids: parsed.grids.length,\r\n          issues: parsed.issues,\r\n        }\r\n      }),\r\n    ).toEqual([\r\n      {\r\n        file: 'yokohama-p14.json',\r\n        grids: 0,\r\n        issues: ['?싥굤??꺀?쇻꺂?ゆ쩂??],\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        file: 'yokohama-p13.json',\r\n        grids: 0,\r\n        issues: ['?싥굤??꺀?쇻꺂?ゆ쩂??],\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        file: 'ojkk-p2.json',\r\n        grids: 0,\r\n        issues: ['?싥굤??꺀?쇻꺂?ゆ쩂??],\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        file: 'ojkk-p3.json',\r\n        grids: 0,\r\n        issues: ['?싥굤??꺀?쇻꺂?ゆ쩂??],\r\n      },\r\n    ])\r\n  })\r\n})\r\n\r\nfunction grid(\r\n  candidates: PlanGridCandidate[],\r\n  direction: 'X' | 'Y',\r\n): PlanGridCandidate {\r\n  const found = candidates.find((entry) => entry.direction === direction)\r\n  expect(found, `missing ${direction} grid`).toBeDefined()\r\n  return found as PlanGridCandidate\r\n}\r\n\r\n// 湲곕?媛믪? ?꾨㈃?먯꽌 ?낅┰ ?꾩궗??媛믪씠??(?먮낯: tests/fixtures/section-import/SOURCES.md).\r\n// 異??꾩튂(pt)???꾨㈃ 醫뚰몴???ш린 諛뺤? ?딄퀬 ?⑥“ 利앷?留?蹂몃떎 ???꾨㈃??吏꾩떎?\r\n// ?쇰꺼 ?쒖꽌? ?ㅽ뙩 移섏닔(mm)??\r\n\r\ndescribe('yokohama p7 (2?롥틞鴉뤷쎋?팕?롥틞鴉뤷쎋)', () => {\r\n  const parsed = parseFramingPlan(readPage('yokohama-p7.json'))\r\n\r\n  it('??釉붾줉쨌?묐떒 以묐났???묓? X쨌Y 媛?1媛쒖쓽 ?꾨낫媛 ?⑤뒗??, () => {\r\n    expect(parsed.issues).toEqual([])\r\n    expect(parsed.grids).toHaveLength(2)\r\n  })\r\n\r\n  it('X: bX1?밷X3쨌cX1, ?ㅽ뙩 8700쨌8700쨌1200', () => {\r\n    const x = grid(parsed.grids, 'X')\r\n    expect(x.axes.map((axis) => axis.label)).toEqual([\r\n      'bX1',\r\n      'bX2',\r\n      'bX3',\r\n      'cX1',\r\n    ])\r\n    expect(x.spansMm).toEqual([8700, 8700, 1200])\r\n    expect(x.totalConfirmed).toBe(false)\r\n  })\r\n\r\n  it('Y: bY6?뭕Y1 (?꾨㈃ 洹몃?濡쒖쓽 ?쒖꽌), ?ㅽ뙩 5000쨌6000쨌10000쨌6000쨌5000', () => {\r\n    const y = grid(parsed.grids, 'Y')\r\n    expect(y.axes.map((axis) => axis.label)).toEqual([\r\n      'bY6',\r\n      'bY5',\r\n      'bY4',\r\n      'bY3',\r\n      'bY2',\r\n      'bY1',\r\n    ])\r\n    expect(y.spansMm).toEqual([5000, 6000, 10000, 6000, 5000])\r\n    expect(y.totalConfirmed).toBe(false)\r\n  })\r\n\r\n  it('異??꾩튂???⑥“ 利앷??섍퀬 ?ㅼ륫 異뺤쿃? 1/100 遺洹쇱씠??, () => {\r\n    for (const candidate of parsed.grids) {\r\n      const positions = candidate.axes.map((axis) => axis.positionPt)\r\n      expect([...positions].sort((a, b) => a - b)).toEqual(positions)\r\n      // 1/100 ?꾨㈃??pt/mm = 72 / 25.4 / 100 ??0.02835\r\n      expect(candidate.scalePtPerMm).toBeGreaterThan(0.027)\r\n      expect(candidate.scalePtPerMm).toBeLessThan(0.03)\r\n    }\r\n  })\r\n})\r\n\r\ndescribe('kani p38 (?븀쨴鴉뤷쎋)', () => {\r\n  const parsed = parseFramingPlan(readPage('kani-p38.json'))\r\n\r\n  it('X: X1?밲4, ?ㅽ뙩 6000쨌6000쨌8000 ???꾩껜 移섏닔 20,000?쇰줈 ?뺤씤?쒕떎', () => {\r\n    const x = grid(parsed.grids, 'X')\r\n    expect(x.axes.map((axis) => axis.label)).toEqual(['X1', 'X2', 'X3', 'X4'])\r\n    expect(x.spansMm).toEqual([6000, 6000, 8000])\r\n    expect(x.totalConfirmed).toBe(true)\r\n  })\r\n\r\n  it('Y: ?꾨㈃ 醫뚢넂?곌? Y3쨌Y2쨌Y1 ???ㅽ뙩 6000쨌10500, ?꾩껜 16,500?쇰줈 ?뺤씤?쒕떎', () => {\r\n    const y = grid(parsed.grids, 'Y')\r\n    expect(y.axes.map((axis) => axis.label)).toEqual(['Y3', 'Y2', 'Y1'])\r\n    expect(y.spansMm).toEqual([6000, 10500])\r\n    expect(y.totalConfirmed).toBe(true)\r\n  })\r\n\r\n  it('?몃? 移섏닔 ?곗뇙(2,800+3,200 ????以묒젏 留ㅼ묶??諛곗젣?쒕떎', () => {\r\n    expect(parsed.issues).toEqual([])\r\n    expect(parsed.grids).toHaveLength(2)\r\n  })\r\n})\r\n\r\n// ?꾨옒 諛곗튂 湲곕?媛믪? ?쎌뒪泥?醫뚰몴瑜??먯쑝濡?寃?고빐 ?살뿀??(?뚯꽌 異쒕젰?먯꽌 ?좊룄?섏?\r\n// ?딅뒗????ADR-010). 寃??洹쇨굅: 醫뚮툝濡앹쓽 ?싥굤???ㅼ쥖?쒕뒗 bX1=510쨌bX2=757쨌\r\n// bX3=1003쨌cX1=1037(x), bY6=216쨌bY5=358쨌bY4=528쨌bY3=812쨌bY2=982쨌bY1=1123(y)?대떎.\r\n//   C51@(528,207)  ??x??bX1(510)?먯꽌 18pt, y??bY6(216)?먯꽌 9pt        ???쇔춴??0,0)\r\n//   G51@(880,335)  ??x??bX2?밷X3 以묒젏(880)???뺥솗?? y??bY5(358)?먯꽌 23 ??渦?X(1,1)\r\n//   C53@(528,519)  ??bX1(18) 쨌 bY4(9)                                    ???쇔춴??0,2)\r\n//   CB52@(476,669) ??bX1(34) 쨌 bY4?밷Y3 以묒젏(670)?먯꽌 1pt                 ??渦?Y(0,2)\r\ndescribe('yokohama p7 ??遺??諛곗튂', () => {\r\n  const parsed = parseFramingPlan(readPage('yokohama-p7.json'))\r\n\r\n  it('???μ쓽 鴉뤷쎋媛 媛곴컖 釉붾줉???섍퀬 ?쒕ぉ???먮Ц?濡?媛뽯뒗??, () => {\r\n    expect(parsed.blocks.map((block) => block.title)).toEqual([\r\n      '2?롥틞鴉뤷쎋1/100',\r\n      'R?롥틞鴉뤷쎋1/100',\r\n    ])\r\n  })\r\n\r\n  it('釉붾줉留덈떎 ?먭린 ?꾩튂???싥굤??쓣 媛뽯뒗?????쇰꺼? 媛숆퀬 醫뚰몴???ㅻⅤ??, () => {\r\n    const [left, right] = parsed.blocks\r\n    expect(left.xGrid.axes.map((axis) => axis.label)).toEqual(\r\n      right.xGrid.axes.map((axis) => axis.label),\r\n    )\r\n    expect(left.xGrid.axes[0].positionPt).toBeLessThan(\r\n      right.xGrid.axes[0].positionPt,\r\n    )\r\n    expect(left.yGrid.axes.map((axis) => axis.label)).toEqual([\r\n      'bY6',\r\n      'bY5',\r\n      'bY4',\r\n      'bY3',\r\n      'bY2',\r\n      'bY1',\r\n    ])\r\n  })\r\n\r\n  it('?깅뒗 ?쇔춴?? 鸚㎪쥈??渦븐쑝濡?遺숇뒗??, () => {\r\n    const placements = parsed.blocks[0].placements\r\n    expect(placements).toContainEqual({\r\n      mark: 'C51',\r\n      role: '?쇔춴??,\r\n      ix: 0,\r\n      iy: 0,\r\n    })\r\n    expect(placements).toContainEqual({\r\n      mark: 'C53',\r\n      role: '?쇔춴??,\r\n      ix: 0,\r\n      iy: 2,\r\n    })\r\n    expect(placements).toContainEqual({\r\n      mark: 'G51',\r\n      role: '渦?,\r\n      ix: 1,\r\n      iy: 1,\r\n      axis: 'X',\r\n    })\r\n    expect(placements).toContainEqual({\r\n      mark: 'CB52',\r\n      role: '渦?,\r\n      ix: 0,\r\n      iy: 2,\r\n      axis: 'Y',\r\n    })\r\n  })\r\n\r\n  it('遺?몃뒗 ?꾨㈃???덈뒗 留뚰겮留??섏삤怨?吏?대궡吏 ?딅뒗??, () => {\r\n    // 弱뤸쥈?쇰줈 ?섍쾶 ?섎돏 移??덉쓽 ?ㅳ꺀?뼿룟컦歟?遺?몃뒗 訝??듐굤??뿉 遺숈? ?딅뒗????\n    // ?쒗뭹??弱뤸쥈??紐⑤뜽留곹븯吏 ?딆쑝誘濡?ADR-005) 遺숈씪 ?먮━ ?먯껜媛 ?녿떎\r\n    for (const block of parsed.blocks) {\r\n      expect(block.placements.length).toBeGreaterThan(0)\r\n      for (const placement of block.placements) {\r\n        expect(placement.ix).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(0)\r\n        expect(placement.ix).toBeLessThan(block.xGrid.axes.length)\r\n        expect(placement.iy).toBeGreaterThanOrEqual(0)\r\n        expect(placement.iy).toBeLessThan(block.yGrid.axes.length)\r\n        if (placement.role === '渦? && placement.axis === 'X') {\r\n          expect(placement.ix).toBeLessThan(block.xGrid.axes.length - 1)\r\n        }\r\n        if (placement.role === '渦? && placement.axis === 'Y') {\r\n          expect(placement.iy).toBeLessThan(block.yGrid.axes.length - 1)\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  })\r\n})\r\n\r\n--- package scripts ---\r\n{\r\n    \"dev\":  \"next dev\",\r\n    \"build\":  \"next build\",\r\n    \"lint\":  \"eslint .\",\r\n    \"typecheck\":  \"tsc --noEmit\",\r\n    \"test\":  \"vitest run\",\r\n    \"test:golden\":  \"vitest run tests/golden\",\r\n    \"lighthouse\":  \"lhci autorun --config=lighthouserc.cjs\",\r\n    \"perf:measure\":  \"rm -rf .lighthouseci; LHCI_RUNS=1 lhci autorun --config=lighthouserc.cjs; node scripts/perf/report.mjs\",\r\n    \"eval\":  \"tsx --env-file-if-exists=.env evals/harness/run.ts\",\r\n    \"test:hooks\":  \"bash scripts/hooks/tdd-guard.spec.sh\",\r\n    \"hooks:install\":  \"git config core.hooksPath scripts/githooks\",\r\n    \"test:ci-scripts\":  \"bash scripts/ci/scrub-secrets.spec.sh \\u0026\\u0026 bash scripts/ci/review-scope.spec.sh \\u0026\\u0026 bash scripts/ci/review-carryforward.spec.sh \\u0026\\u0026 bash scripts/ci/review-verdict.spec.sh \\u0026\\u0026 bash scripts/ci/distill-failure-log.spec.sh \\u0026\\u0026 node --test .claude/workflows/review-code.test.js scripts/perf/budget-report.test.mjs scripts/perf/blocking-graph.test.mjs\"\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
